.15);\n  }\n  .ph-cat { width: 130px; height: 175px; right: 10px; top: 365px; }\n  .ph-leaves { width: 60px; height: 200px; right: 0; top: 150px; }\n  .ph-bamboo { width: 200px; height: 40px; left: 150px; bottom: 0; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <h1>租房注意事项</h1>\n\n  <div><span class=\"bullet\"></span><span class=\"section-title\">卧室</span></div>\n\n  <p class=\"item\">1.空调是否正常使用，空调排水位置，外机位置</p>\n  <p class=\"item\">2.所有电灯，插座是否ok</p>\n  <p class=\"item\">3.床都否OK，躺下翻身是否有响声</p>\n  <p class=\"item\">4.卧室地板情况</p>\n  <p class=\"item\">5.衣柜是否完好</p>\n  <p class=\"item\">6.各个房间是否能反锁</p>\n  <p class=\"item\">7.装修情况，不要太新，也不要太久</p>\n  <p class=\"item\">8.排查针孔摄像头</p>\n  <p class=\"item\">9.wifi信号情况</p>\n\n  <div><span class=\"bullet\"></span><span class=\"section-title\">其他</span></div>\n\n  <p class=\"item row-two\"><span>1.各类遥控器清点</span><span>2.所有钥匙清点</span></p>\n  <p class=\"item\">3.所有墙面情况，有无裂痕掉漆，脱皮</p>\n  <p class=\"item\">4.所有水龙头一起打开，看水压是否足够</p>\n  <p class=\"item\">5.如果是燃气热水器，也留意下安全使用情况</p>\n\n  <div class=\"watermark\">@带毛的栗子<br>From 小红书</div>\n\n  <figure class=\"placeholder ph-leaves\">[Decoration: leaves, right edge]</figure>\n  <figure class=\"placeholder ph-cat\">[Illustration: cartoon cat, right side]</figure>\n  <figure class=\"placeholder ph-bamboo\">[Decoration: bamboo, bottom center]</figure>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
